(7475214, 1187754, 163081, '<td valign="top">The pastel colors/tones make this picture so romantic. If it''s not a setup, very nice catch. The girl''s hair could have been a little sharper as this is where my eye is always going to when looking at this picture. Simple title that really fits. A 9 from me and my Red Dragon Award<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173262" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173262.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The pastel colors/tones make this picture so romantic. If it''s not a setup, very nice catch. The girl''s hair could have been a little sharper as this is where my eye is always going to when looking at this picture. Simple title that really fits. A 9 from me and my Red Dragon Award', '2016-09-22 14:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475215, 1187539, 163081, '<td valign="top">Your title gives a hint to start exploring this amazing scene searching for Indiana Jones. after few second I felt satisfied to find him, but then....making my imagination to create a whole story around this picture.<br/>Really like it. A 9 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Your title gives a hint to start exploring this amazing scene searching for Indiana Jones. after few second I felt satisfied to find him, but then....making my imagination to create a whole story around this picture.Really like it. A 9 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award  ', '2016-09-22 14:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475216, 1187933, 163081, '<td valign="top">I really like this type of pictures. Gothic processing with suburban décor. That far away city almost in the clouds. Great photography. A 9 from me</td>', 'I really like this type of pictures. Gothic processing with suburban décor. That far away city almost in the clouds. Great photography. A 9 from me', '2016-09-22 15:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
