(7475494, 1187909, 150277, '<td valign="top">My favorite scene in the challenge.  The grass and the trees look a little funny to me, like more wiggly than I would expect in real life.  Especially the foreground grass doesn''t quite seem to be the same as grass near the tombstone.  Processing?  The mowing?  But the oddness (which admittedly could be totally natural) kept me from feeling totally sucked in and the I struggled to fully connect emotionally.</td>', 'My favorite scene in the challenge.  The grass and the trees look a little funny to me, like more wiggly than I would expect in real life.  Especially the foreground grass doesn''t quite seem to be the same as grass near the tombstone.  Processing?  The mowing?  But the oddness (which admittedly could be totally natural) kept me from feeling totally sucked in and the I struggled to fully connect emotionally.', '2016-09-23 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475586, 1187538, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture, the expression is perfect and the antique treatment helps with the emotive theme. Great work should be up there in the ribbons</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture, the expression is perfect and the antique treatment helps with the emotive theme. Great work should be up there in the ribbons', '2016-09-25 04:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475587, 1187552, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo for the challenge. I just wish that the girls feet were in the frame</td>', 'This is a great photo for the challenge. I just wish that the girls feet were in the frame', '2016-09-25 04:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475588, 1187916, 19959, '<td valign="top">Interesting treatment. I was in Garda on vacation around this time also :)</td>', 'Interesting treatment. I was in Garda on vacation around this time also :)', '2016-09-25 04:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475589, 1187918, 19959, '<td valign="top">Cracking shot. Good luck</td>', 'Cracking shot. Good luck', '2016-09-25 04:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475590, 1187533, 19959, '<td valign="top">This works well. Self Portrait?</td>', 'This works well. Self Portrait?', '2016-09-25 04:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475591, 1187682, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great sense of drama.</td>', 'Great sense of drama.', '2016-09-25 04:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475592, 1187927, 19959, '<td valign="top">That is a dramatic sky! - Well captured. The people really add to the sense of scale here</td>', 'That is a dramatic sky! - Well captured. The people really add to the sense of scale here', '2016-09-25 04:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475885, 1187909, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just a tad over processed, but the impact in incredible. Wonder composition.</td>', 'Just a tad over processed, but the impact in incredible. Wonder composition.', '2016-09-27 11:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475886, 1187882, 101256, '<td valign="top">The very slight color cast makes this an extraordinary capture.</td>', 'The very slight color cast makes this an extraordinary capture.', '2016-09-27 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475887, 1187577, 101256, '<td valign="top">The free spirit of the little one is very evident - excellent capture.</td>', 'The free spirit of the little one is very evident - excellent capture.', '2016-09-27 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475888, 1187539, 101256, '<td valign="top">A tad darker than it should be, still rates as an excellent composition. Well done.</td>', 'A tad darker than it should be, still rates as an excellent composition. Well done.', '2016-09-27 11:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475889, 1187854, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image invoked the classic Hemmingway "Old Man and The Sea" - very interesting composition.</td>', 'This image invoked the classic Hemmingway "Old Man and The Sea" - very interesting composition.', '2016-09-27 11:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475891, 1187916, 101256, '<td valign="top">A touch lighter would have helped, but the impact of the image is very strong - invokes a sense of time and space.</td>', 'A touch lighter would have helped, but the impact of the image is very strong - invokes a sense of time and space.', '2016-09-27 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475892, 1187533, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very contemplative serene and peaceful composition  - originally a 9 re-rated a 10.</td>', 'A very contemplative serene and peaceful composition  - originally a 9 re-rated a 10.', '2016-09-27 11:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475893, 1187799, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like this -it just seemed to me to be an intrusion into a private moment - almost voyeuristic in concept. After looking at it several times, I''ve changed my mind considerably. I originally rated this an 8, but it deserves a 9 for a different look into everyday life.</td>', 'At first I didn''t like this -it just seemed to me to be an intrusion into a private moment - almost voyeuristic in concept. After looking at it several times, I''ve changed my mind considerably. I originally rated this an 8, but it deserves a 9 for a different look into everyday life.', '2016-09-27 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475894, 1187728, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another that I feel I rated to low originally. Certainly, it''s not a technical tour de'' force, but the intent is readily apparent. Time, distance and space - all interact in this image to give a sense of commitment. Excellent. From an 8 to a 9.</td>', 'Another that I feel I rated to low originally. Certainly, it''s not a technical tour de'' force, but the intent is readily apparent. Time, distance and space - all interact in this image to give a sense of commitment. Excellent. From an 8 to a 9.', '2016-09-27 11:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475897, 1187880, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really don''t have a lot to say here - to be fair, my initial reaction was "meh - another snapshot" which I ordinarily rate as a 6 or 7, but there is something here that I can''t quite understand - I like it, but I don''t know why.</td>', 'I really don''t have a lot to say here - to be fair, my initial reaction was "meh - another snapshot" which I ordinarily rate as a 6 or 7, but there is something here that I can''t quite understand - I like it, but I don''t know why.', '2016-09-27 11:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475900, 1187754, 101256, '<td valign="top">I always like to do one or more pass through views before rating, then I go back and start over again with comments. I do that because initial reactions can often mislead. In this case, I like the sense of time and distance - from a technical standpoint, it''s a good, well composed capture. I change the rating from 8 to a 9.</td>', 'I always like to do one or more pass through views before rating, then I go back and start over again with comments. I do that because initial reactions can often mislead. In this case, I like the sense of time and distance - from a technical standpoint, it''s a good, well composed capture. I change the rating from 8 to a 9.', '2016-09-27 11:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475901, 1187932, 101256, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it frankly - I know I''m missing something.</td>', 'I don''t get it frankly - I know I''m missing something.', '2016-09-27 11:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475902, 1187707, 101256, '<td valign="top">Hay field, dogs and kids - what''s not to like?</td>', 'Hay field, dogs and kids - what''s not to like?', '2016-09-27 11:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475904, 1187552, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve been exactly in that same spot - incredible and amazing geography. This doesn''t quite capture the overall color and shapes, but the sense of what could be is there. A little more thought in composing the image would have helped.</td>', 'I''ve been exactly in that same spot - incredible and amazing geography. This doesn''t quite capture the overall color and shapes, but the sense of what could be is there. A little more thought in composing the image would have helped.', '2016-09-27 11:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475905, 1187801, 101256, '<td valign="top">I truly enjoy these fun captures - well done.</td>', 'I truly enjoy these fun captures - well done.', '2016-09-27 11:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475906, 1187583, 101256, '<td valign="top">One of the best conversions I''ve seen - quite good actually - almost perfect. Maybe just a tad light, but not noticeable unless you are really into gray scale or B&amp;W.</td>', 'One of the best conversions I''ve seen - quite good actually - almost perfect. Maybe just a tad light, but not noticeable unless you are really into gray scale or B&W.', '2016-09-27 11:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475907, 1187875, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific moment in time at the Misión la Purísima Concepción de María Santísima. I originally rated this 8 but I''ve changed my mind after several viewings - this is a 10 for sure. (One of my good friends is a Friar and I spent some time there.)</td>', 'A terrific moment in time at the Misión la Purísima Concepción de María Santísima. I originally rated this 8 but I''ve changed my mind after several viewings - this is a 10 for sure. (One of my good friends is a Friar and I spent some time there.)', '2016-09-27 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475909, 1187933, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another image that I originally under rated during my rating pass. I''ve done an injustice to this - it is incredibly detailed, the title is perfect, the overall emotional impact is purposeful and contemplative. A brilliant capture and worthy of a 10 and certainly a top 5 place.</td>', 'Another image that I originally under rated during my rating pass. I''ve done an injustice to this - it is incredibly detailed, the title is perfect, the overall emotional impact is purposeful and contemplative. A brilliant capture and worthy of a 10 and certainly a top 5 place.', '2016-09-27 12:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475910, 1187378, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good sound image that captures the run of climbing a hill and looking at the scenery.</td>', 'A good sound image that captures the run of climbing a hill and looking at the scenery.', '2016-09-27 12:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475911, 1187889, 101256, '<td valign="top">To tell the truth, it took me some time to find the subject - nice capture.</td>', 'To tell the truth, it took me some time to find the subject - nice capture.', '2016-09-27 12:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475912, 1187934, 101256, '<td valign="top">Way to light, needed some more post processing to bring out some detail - the over all image seems much too washed out.</td>', 'Way to light, needed some more post processing to bring out some detail - the over all image seems much too washed out.', '2016-09-27 12:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475913, 1187923, 101256, '<td valign="top">I struggled with this image - I have the concept just fine - sense of loss, impending doom if you will, darkness and all the associated sense of foreboding - got it. There''s nothing wrong technically, I just am not overwhelmed by a positive response to the image.</td>', 'I struggled with this image - I have the concept just fine - sense of loss, impending doom if you will, darkness and all the associated sense of foreboding - got it. There''s nothing wrong technically, I just am not overwhelmed by a positive response to the image.', '2016-09-27 12:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475914, 1187703, 101256, '<td valign="top">Tranquility personified. Very nice capture.</td>', 'Tranquility personified. Very nice capture.', '2016-09-27 12:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475915, 1187918, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another time, distance and space image with a lot to recommend it in those terms. I can''t really find anything that I''d want to complain about - maybe a tad too much space at the top of the image - a crop would have been warranted. Still, my initial impression was related to the empty space, so I''ve change this from a 7 to a 9.</td>', 'Another time, distance and space image with a lot to recommend it in those terms. I can''t really find anything that I''d want to complain about - maybe a tad too much space at the top of the image - a crop would have been warranted. Still, my initial impression was related to the empty space, so I''ve change this from a 7 to a 9.', '2016-09-27 12:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475916, 1187866, 101256, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of the "flowing water" genre of landscape scenery. This is overdone - I would have preferred to see a more natural waterfall than what was captured. However, it still is a very nice image with some interesting color variations and from a viewer''s perspective, it is interesting.</td>', 'I am not a fan of the "flowing water" genre of landscape scenery. This is overdone - I would have preferred to see a more natural waterfall than what was captured. However, it still is a very nice image with some interesting color variations and from a viewer''s perspective, it is interesting.', '2016-09-27 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475917, 1187919, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot except for one little detail - the people at the top center. This would have been a top ten for it''s beauty and surreal, almost ethereal landscape - a fantasy land, but the color at the top just sort of ruins the overall impact - for me that is - my opinion. Still, I under rated this and moved from a 7 to a 8.</td>', 'I like this image a lot except for one little detail - the people at the top center. This would have been a top ten for it''s beauty and surreal, almost ethereal landscape - a fantasy land, but the color at the top just sort of ruins the overall impact - for me that is - my opinion. Still, I under rated this and moved from a 7 to a 8.', '2016-09-27 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475918, 1187864, 101256, '<td valign="top">I found myself more interested in the boat than the other parts of the image. Neat idea to have that wooden bench and fence.  I have an older pontoon that I wanted to fix up (I have a brand new one also) - this gave me some ideas. Anyway, be that as it may, I think it is a little over exposed, but a fun image nonetheless.</td>', 'I found myself more interested in the boat than the other parts of the image. Neat idea to have that wooden bench and fence.  I have an older pontoon that I wanted to fix up (I have a brand new one also) - this gave me some ideas. Anyway, be that as it may, I think it is a little over exposed, but a fun image nonetheless.', '2016-09-27 12:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475919, 1187722, 101256, '<td valign="top">When do my second and third passes, I sometimes end up extracting the foot from my....well anyway, this is a brilliant image and I don''t know why I didn''t see that the first time through - I usually rate my 10 images first go through, but for some reason I under rated this. A terrific candid capture - perfect in a lot of ways. Originally 7, now a 10.</td>', 'When do my second and third passes, I sometimes end up extracting the foot from my....well anyway, this is a brilliant image and I don''t know why I didn''t see that the first time through - I usually rate my 10 images first go through, but for some reason I under rated this. A terrific candid capture - perfect in a lot of ways. Originally 7, now a 10.', '2016-09-27 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7475920, 1187874, 101256, '<td valign="top">The color on this is just a little bit overdone, but....there is a lot of color in the image. A interesting image with a lot to look at - seems overly busy and loses something when viewed.</td>', 'The color on this is just a little bit overdone, but....there is a lot of color in the image. A interesting image with a lot to look at - seems overly busy and loses something when viewed.', '2016-09-27 12:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
