(7476128, 1187682, 98565, '<td valign="top">Hey Alecia - what an impressive comeback! Congrats on the red!<br/>How''re doing???</td>', 'Hey Alecia - what an impressive comeback! Congrats on the red!How''re doing???', '2016-09-28 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
