(7476492, 1187682, 33068, '<td valign="top">It''s at Utah Lake.  Thanks for asking <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/96751.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/96751.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/96751.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>.</td>', 'It''s at Utah Lake.  Thanks for asking  tanguera.', '2016-10-01 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7476586, 1187880, 100831, '<td valign="top">I think this would have scored better if she had been coming towards you but I do love the colors and composition, along with the foreground bokeh. Nicely done.</td>', 'I think this would have scored better if she had been coming towards you but I do love the colors and composition, along with the foreground bokeh. Nicely done.', '2016-10-02 13:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7476928, 1187927, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the hm, Penny. What awesome pre-storm light!</td>', 'Congrats on the hm, Penny. What awesome pre-storm light!', '2016-10-03 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7477484, 1187934, 98565, '<td valign="top">there are more than one level to get emotive.<br/>The combination of people, basket and bird is special and rises so many questions.<br/>Does the basket belong to the women<br/>Will the bird snatch something from the basket<br/>Why does the man wear a t-shirt, didn''t he enter the sea?<br/>Is it a mobile he''s holding in his hand<br/>Is it mother and daughter<br/> <br/>I''d like to hear the sound of the pic - the sea and the gull<br/></td>', 'there are more than one level to get emotive.The combination of people, basket and bird is special and rises so many questions.Does the basket belong to the womenWill the bird snatch something from the basketWhy does the man wear a t-shirt, didn''t he enter the sea?Is it a mobile he''s holding in his handIs it mother and daughter I''d like to hear the sound of the pic - the sea and the gull', '2016-10-07 03:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483929, 1187878, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>I do like the furtive nature of this shot...even if he is holding the cigarette backwards :-)  The lighting is basic but very effective, and the bike in the background helps emphasize his youth.  I like the stark shadow behind him, the comp, the use of b/w and your settings show that you know what you''re doing.  <br/> <br/>This reminds me of the book covers of SE Hinton, who wrote gritty teen novels, often about kids growing up in hard circumstances.  Google her name and you will see what I mean.  There is definitely a flicker of defiance there in his eyes and the way he''s looking up at you helps convey the ''So whaddaya gonna do about it, Dad?'' rebelliousness.  Maybe not quite James Dean, but not a bad start!<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, in terms of an Emotive Landscape, this isn''t quite what was expected.  I do think that this could have made a very emotive portrait though.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps, please continue to shoot and enter!<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! I do like the furtive nature of this shot...even if he is holding the cigarette backwards :-)  The lighting is basic but very effective, and the bike in the background helps emphasize his youth.  I like the stark shadow behind him, the comp, the use of b/w and your settings show that you know what you''re doing.   This reminds me of the book covers of SE Hinton, who wrote gritty teen novels, often about kids growing up in hard circumstances.  Google her name and you will see what I mean.  There is definitely a flicker of defiance there in his eyes and the way he''s looking up at you helps convey the ''So whaddaya gonna do about it, Dad?'' rebelliousness.  Maybe not quite James Dean, but not a bad start! Unfortunately, in terms of an Emotive Landscape, this isn''t quite what was expected.  I do think that this could have made a very emotive portrait though. Hope this helps, please continue to shoot and enter! Susan', '2016-11-23 19:07:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7512589, 1187754, 182284, '<td valign="top">So beautiful and dreamy.</td>', 'So beautiful and dreamy.', '2017-05-08 14:02:07.000000', NULL, 0);
